you get the output measurements and also the state measurements after the task S.

26
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:25,764
接着你执行控制计算和执行任务，这就形成了一个流水段。
You then do a control computation and an actuation task, and this then forms one pipe.

27
00:03:26,158 --> 00:03:28,740
所以 SCA 的组合就是一个流水段。
So the SCA combination is a one pipe.

28
00:03:29,838 --> 00:03:38,436
下一帧在 K 加 1 到达，然后你执行第二个流水段，
执行第三个流水段，然后继续执行后续的流水段。
So the next frame arrives at K plus one and then you execute the second pipe
and you execute the third pipe and then you continue executing the pipes.

29
00:03:40,014 --> 00:03:45,760
这里的采样周期等于帧到达周期 fH。
So here the sampling period is equal to the frame arrival period fH.

30
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:50,916
